# 统一换行符：仓库内一律 LF，避免 Windows 上 Git 反复提示
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF"，也避免跨平台协作时整文件 diff。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本保持 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制：不要做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite3 binary
*.zip binary

# 让 GitHub 语言统计不要把这些算进去
data/seed-census.json linguist-vendored
